001 - Praise to the Lord
Joachim Neander / Choral Book for England
Key: F
Time: 3/4
Tempo: 104
Number: 1
Topic: Worship - Adoration and Praise

Verse 1:
[F]Praise [Dm]to [C/E]the [F]Lord, the [Dm]Almighty, [F]the [Bb]King [C7/G]of [Dm]creation!
[F]O [Dm]my [C/E]soul, [F]praise Him, [Dm]for [Am]He [Bb]is [F]thy [Bb]health [C7/G]and [Dm]salvation!
[F]All [C/E]ye [F]who [Bb]hear, [F]Now [Bb/D]to [C/E]His [F]temple draw [C]near;
[Am]Join [Bb]ye [C7/G]in [Dm]glad [Gm/Bb]adoration!

Verse 2:
[F]Praise [Dm]to [C/E]the [F]Lord, who [Dm]o'er [Am]all [Bb]things [F]so [Bb]wondrously reigneth,
[F]Shieldeth [C/E]thee [F]under [Dm]His [Am]wings, [Bb]yea, [F]so [Bb]gently [Dm]sustaineth!
[F]Hast thou [C/E]not [F]seen [Bb]How [F]thy [Bb/D]desires [Gm]e'er [F]have [C]been
[Am]Granted [C7/G]in [Dm]what [Gm/Bb]He [Am]ordaineth?

Verse 3:
[F]Praise [Dm]to [C/E]the [F]Lord, who [Dm]doth [Am]prosper [F]thy [Bb]work [C7/G]and [Dm]defend [F]thee;
[F]Surely [C/E]His [F]goodness [Dm]and [Am]mercy [F]here [Bb]daily [Dm]attend [F]thee.
